        "gg7Hqf8LPaO_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\"><strong>Most families see results the first night</strong> – just like we did. But even if it takes a few weeks for full transformation, you're protected by that 90-night guarantee.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">No more 3 AM wake-ups. No more exhausted mornings. No more family tension over the dog.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">Just peaceful nights and happy, well-rested dogs.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\"><strong>The solution exists. The guarantee protects you.&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\"><strong>The only question is: are you ready to finally sleep through the night?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggX_wjTy8-i_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;\"><i>Due to limited ingredient availability, Chuffy's frequently sells out. If available now, we recommend securing your supply today.</i></span></p>",
        "ggYl18Y7Q_1_text": "<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:28px;\"><strong>GET CHUFFY'S DREAMY PUP CHEWS - 90 NIGHT GUARANTEE</strong></span>",
