        "gg7UrAEjoaJ_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\"><strong>3:17 AM.</strong> Again.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">That's what the clock read when Bella's scratching jolted me awake for the fourth time tonight.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">Eight months of this. Two-hour walks every day. A $500 trainer. Expensive calming treats, CBD oil, even prescription anxiety meds.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">Nothing worked.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">My partner was talking about \"choosing between the dog and our relationship.\" The kids were cranky from no sleep.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">I was falling asleep in work meetings.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">I felt like the world's worst dog parent.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">Then I met Dr. Sarah Martinez, and everything changed.</span></p>",
        "gg8veIxA9mu_label": "<p>CHECK AVAILABILITY</p>",
        "ggBELzjFrTj_label": "<p>CHECK AVAILABILITY</p>",
        "ggCb6w5EEPN_text": "<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:26px;\"><strong>GET CHUFFY'S DREAMY PUP CHEWS - 90 NIGHT GUARANTEE</strong></span>",
        "ggF7XlRBOiA_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">Desperate, I tried it. 9 PM – gave Bella one chew.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">9:47 PM – she laid down and closed her eyes.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">I watched the clock: 10 PM... 11 PM... midnight... still sleeping.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\">I woke up at 7 AM to my&nbsp;<strong>alarm clock</strong>, not scratching at the door.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:17px;\"><strong>For the first time in eight months, my entire family slept through the night.</strong></span></p>",
        "ggKVOYQODZg_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#242424;\">2,500+ Verified Reviews!</span></p>",
